stateDiagram-v2
  state {{ucName}} {
    [*] --> Start
    Start --> Form : Actor opens the function
    Form --> Validate : Actor submits data
    Validate --> Form : System reports errors
    Validate --> Done : System accepts the data
    Done --> [*]
  }

  note right of Form
    Actor: opens the function
    System: shows the form
  end note
